          "current": "\t\t, \"Each retained field job must complete successfully and match its exact artifact even when unrelated jobs make the enclosing Downstream run fail or when the run is cancelled after both field jobs finish. The enclosing run conclusion is retained per leg; no result from another matrix job is claimed.\"\n",
